# 6. Reflection

Enterprise systems react automatically to data changes because businesses need real-time responses, automation, accuracy, and efficiency.

Modern applications handle huge amounts of data every second. Manual monitoring is impossible. Automation tools like Triggers and Flows help systems respond instantly whenever data changes.

## Examples
- Sending notifications
- Updating related records
- Maintaining data consistency
- Reducing human effort
- Improving customer experience

Automatic reactions help organizations save time, reduce errors, and improve productivity.

